      ],
      "chunk_id": "06d7e7e5-b2f6-4da6-b5f6-987b10266c52",
      "content": "Wellness Stipend\n\nEligible full-time employees receive a wellness stipend of 750 CAD or 550 USD per calendar year, based on payroll country. The stipend may be used for fitness memberships, mental health apps, ergonomic equipment, or wellness programs.\n\nUnused wellness stipend amounts do not carry over into the next calendar year.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-004",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "e63e8dbf-a320-4863-83cf-939dd76f89ca",
      "content": "Company Devices\n\nEmployees who regularly access company systems should use a company-managed device. Company devices must have disk encryption, endpoint protection, automatic screen lock, and current operating system updates.\n\nEmployees may not disable security tools or remove device management controls from company devices.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002003",
      "document_id": "IT-002",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "efa74b64-3c3e-4f86-bec3-63476871ca6b",
      "content": "Equipment Requests\n\nStandard equipment includes a laptop, charger, headset, keyboard, mouse, and monitor. New-hire equipment is initiated by HR Admin and fulfilled by IT Admin. Replacement equipment requires the employee to state whether the request is due to breakage, loss, upgrade, or accessibility need.\n\nEquipment above the standard bundle requires manager approval. Lost equipment that may contain company data must be reported to IT Admin immediately and should not wait for the next business day.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002011",
      "document_id": "OPS-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Sales Representative",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "ada595ec-d4a0-412b-9dec-047fdbf68542",
      "content": "Learning Budget\n\nEmployees receive an annual learning budget of 1,500 CAD or 1,100 USD for approved courses, books, conferences, and certifications related to their role. Manager approval is required before purchase.\n\nLearning budget requests should include the business purpose and expected outcome. The learning budget is separate from required compliance training.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002001",
      "document_id": "HR-004",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    },
    {
      "access_roles": [
        "Employee",
        "Manager",
        "HR Admin",
        "IT/Admin"
      ],
      "chunk_id": "7f43621b-e723-47b9-b347-6c633696ca67",
      "content": "Shipping and Return Rules\n\nEmployees leaving the company must return company equipment within 10 business days unless HR Admin approves an extension. Operations may provide a prepaid shipping label. Employees should not include personal items in return shipments.\n\nDamaged or missing equipment is reviewed by HR Admin and IT Admin before any payroll or final-pay action. This policy does not authorize payroll deductions by itself.",
      "department_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002011",
      "document_id": "OPS-001",
      "project_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000019",
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000002801"
    }
  ],
